  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information :</strong>  </span>has released the New Exam Date for the post of 72nd Combined Competitive Examination Preliminary Examination 2026. This recruitment has been issued for 1187 posts. Candidates can also check all the details on the official  website. The online application process for BPSC 72nd Recruitment 2026 were accepted from 07 May 2026, to 31 May 2026. The Pre Exam is going to conducted on 25 October 2026. Candidates must Check their BPSC 72nd Pre New Exam Date 2026 given below.</span></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Bihar Public Service Commission (BPSC)</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">BPSC 72nd CCE Pre New Exam Date 2026</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Application Start Date :<strong> 07 May 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Last Date : <strong>31 May 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Fee Payment Last Date : <strong>31 May 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Exam Date : <strong>26 July 2026 (Postponed)</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"background-color: #ffff00; color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">New Exam Date : <strong>25 October 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Admit Card : <strong>Before Exam</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">All Candidates :&nbsp;<strong>Rs. 100/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Bank Charge :&nbsp;<strong>Extra</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates have to pay their Examination Fee Through Debit Card / Credit Card / Net Banking / UPI and Other Fee Payment Mode Only.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">[adinserter block=”3″]</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>BPSC 72nd Pre Notification 2026 : Age Limit</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Age Limit As On 01 August 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Minimum Age :&nbsp;<strong>21 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Maximum Age :&nbsp;<strong>37 Years (Male)&nbsp;</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Maximum Age :&nbsp;<strong>40 Years (Female UR, BC, EBC Male &amp; Female)&nbsp;</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Maximum Age :&nbsp;<strong>42 Years (SC, ST Male &amp; Female)</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Relaxation as per BPSC 72nd Recruitment Rules.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Use <span style=\"background-color: #ffff00; color: #0000ff;\"> </span>Tool – <span style=\"color: #0000ff;\"></span></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>BPSC 72nd Pre 2026 : Vacancy Details</strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Total Posts : 1230-44 = 1187 Posts</strong></span></p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 46.8395%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 26.7848%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Category&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 26.3756%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>No. of Post&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 46.8395%; text-align: center;\" rowspan=\"7\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Bihar BPSC Various Post Under 72nd Pre 2026 Examination</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 26.7848%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">General&nbsp;</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 26.3756%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">513</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 26.7848%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">EWS</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 26.3756%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">116</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 26.7848%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">EBC</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 26.3756%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">196</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 26.7848%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">BC</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 26.3756%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">140</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 26.7848%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">BC-Female</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 26.3756%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">36</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 26.7848%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">SC</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 26.3756%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">175</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 26.7848%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">ST</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 26.3756%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">10</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>BPSC 72nd Pre Online Form 2026 : Post Wise Vacancy Details</b></span></h3>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>No. of Posts</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">72nd Combined (Preliminary Competitive) Examination</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">1033</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Child Development Project Officer</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">20</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Financial Administrative Officer &amp; Equivalent</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">32</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Sub-Divisional Protection Officer</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">101</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>BPSC 72nd Pre Online Form 2026 : Educational Qualification</b></span></h3>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 29.6726%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 70.3274%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Eligibility&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 29.6726%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">72nd Combined (Preliminary Competitive) Examination</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 70.3274%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates must have passed <strong data-start=\"94\" data-end=\"157\">Graduation (Bachelor’s Degree) or an equivalent examination</strong> from a recognized university.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 29.6726%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Child Development Project Officer</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 70.3274%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates must possess a <strong data-start=\"219\" data-end=\"269\">Bachelor’s Degree from a recognized university</strong> and must choose <strong data-start=\"286\" data-end=\"310\">one optional subject</strong> for the main examination from the following:</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Home Science</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Psychology</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Sociology</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Labour &amp; Social Welfare</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 29.6726%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Financial Administrative Officer &amp; Equivalent</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 70.3274%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates must have a <strong data-start=\"477\" data-end=\"557\">Bachelor’s Degree from a recognized university or its affiliated institution</strong> in any one of the following subjects:</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong data-start=\"600\" data-end=\"652\">Commerce, Economics, Mathematics, or Statistics.</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 29.6726%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Sub-Divisional Protection Officer</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 70.3274%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates must possess a<strong data-start=\"683\" data-end=\"733\"> Bachelor’s Degree from a recognized university</strong> in either <strong data-start=\"744\" data-end=\"765\">Psychology or Law</strong>. Additionally, candidates must choose <strong data-start=\"808\" data-end=\"832\" data-is-only-node=\"\">one optional subject</strong> for the main examination from:</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Psychology</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Law</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>BPSC 72nd Pre Exam Date 2026 : How To Download</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates must go to the&nbsp;<strong>Important Links</strong>&nbsp;section below</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Then the candidates must click on the <strong>Exam Date</strong>&nbsp;link.&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">After clicking on the link, the candidates will be redirected to a new page.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">In this page, candidates have to enter the following details:</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Registration no.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Login ID</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Birth Date/Password</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Captcha Code</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Then the candidates have to&nbsp; submit the details by clicking on the Login button.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">After successful login, candidates will be able to download the <strong>Exam Date.</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Alternatively, the candidates can download the <strong>Exam Date&nbsp;</strong>from the&nbsp;<strong>official website of BPSC</strong>&nbsp;also.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>BPSC 72nd Pre Recruitment 2026 : Mode of Selection</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Preliminary Examination</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Mains Examination</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Interview&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Document Verification</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">[adinserter block=”3″]</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable2\">\n<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" data-align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\"><strong>Follow SarkariExam on Instagram</strong></span></td>\n<td class=\"post-social-link\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"3\" data-align=\"center\"><strong></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"4\" data-align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\"><b>Join Our WhatsApp Channel</b></span></td>\n<td class=\"post-social-link\" style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"3\" data-align=\"center\"><strong><a href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VaAbQf01NCrYADMLt00L\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Follow Now</a></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; padding: 0px;\" colspan=\"7\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3><strong>Important Links</strong></h3>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tcell\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"56%\">\n<h4><span style=\"color: #800000;\"><strong>Check </strong></span><span style=\"color: #800000;\"><strong>Corrigendum</strong></span></h4>\n</td>\n<td class=\"tcell\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"43%\">\n<h4 align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://bpsc.bihar.gov.in/wp-content/uploads/BPSC_content/Notices/Corrigendum-72nd-CCE-Substraction-of-2-posts-of-BPS_BPSC-20260903-s7kdy2.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></h4>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tcell\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"56%\">\n<h4><spa